  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "A wire of length <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi></math>&nbsp;is hanging from a fixed support. The length changes to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> when masses <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math> are suspended respectively from its free end. Then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi></math> is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "gEqxM",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub></msqrt></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Y7vUH",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "iCFH6",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "5TpbM",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>From Hooke&#39;s law,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>Y</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>&#8733;</mo><mi>F</mi></math>. Therefore,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>g</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>1</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
